%
% Backward goal: list value lookup, absent-value edge case — gmeow:listIndexOf backing (#1009 §5).
% ex:absent never appears in the list (x y z): the rdf:first/rdf:rest walk exhausts
% at rdf:nil with no rdf:first match, so the goal returns empty bindings, status ok.
:- prefix(ex, 'https://example.org/profiles/goal-rdf-list-functions/').
:- prefix(rdf, 'http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#').
ex:idx(L, X, 0) :- rdf:first(L, X).
ex:idx(L, X, N) :- rdf:rest(L, R), ex:idx(R, X, M), N is M + 1.
?- ex:idx(ex:l0, ex:absent, N).
